LICENSES

The cmrelay source code is offered under MIT or GPL-3.0-or-later.

host/chatmaild/, and the files under host/cmrelay/ that installer/vendor/files.txt
names, are copied from chatmail/relay (MIT).

Patches in installer/vendor/patches/ may also be used
under the licence of the component they patch.

cmrelay-installer, the file a release builds, is GPL-3.0-or-later as a whole.
It bundles other software, each under its own licence. The main components:

  GPL          filtermail (as shipped), coreutils
  LGPL         glibc, parts of dovecot
  IPL or EPL   postfix
  Apache-2.0   OpenSSL, iroh-relay
  Python-2.0   CPython, crypt-r
  MIT/BSD/ISC  dovecot, nginx, unbound, OpenDKIM, ldns, fcgiwrap, acmetool,
               chatmail-turn, jinja2, markdown, qrcode, packaging, bsdtar, zstd
